sentences.text:
To constitute offence under this section following ingredients are to be proved namely:-
1) the representation made by the accused was false;
2) the accused know that the representation was false at the very time when he made it;
3) the accused made the representation with absolute intention of deceiving the victim/complainant;
4) the accused thereby induced the complainant/victim to deceive of property or to do or omit to do something which he could otherwise not have done or omitted.
